      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDSTAR SID (8) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished second and beaten 0.8 lengths (30.02) at this track in Grade 5. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. One of the contenders. SPEED HOLES (6) led throughout to score two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 15 length 6th at this track (35.51). Has good speed so he should be prominent despite the draw. Should be about the money. EVIE SCARLETT (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (31.60) in a Grade 5/6 at Q Lakeside. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Key player if finds best. MAYWYN MICKY (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
